  "prefLabel": "Den 101.06 Certification",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Den 101.06 “Certification” means the process attesting that an individual has met certain predetermined standards specified by the certifying body.\n\nSource. #7969, eff 10-10-03; renumbered by #14140 (formerly Den 101.04)",
